<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.84 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.84 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction February 4 versus January 28  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    98/105    190/228	 343/350</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.04/3.06  3.15/3.20     3.32/3.35</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.04/3.06  3.15/3.21     3.33/3.35</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.04/3.04  3.14/3.17     3.30/3.34</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   220/253    650/110	 970/1,310</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    611/253    800/110     1,120/1,430</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 43,530 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
